  "content": "![](https://i.imgur.com/p6HnjKT.png)\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>自由表达，展现真我！</b></font>\n  <br><br>\n</div>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loader-NeoForge%20%7C%20Fabric-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Version-1.20.1%20%7C%201.21.1%20%7C%201.21.11-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Architectury%20API-required-ecebe6?labelColor=fc7200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n</div>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Server%20side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Client%20side-required-ecebe6?labelColor=078200&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  <br>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/AKMkECwnqf\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/973266096763318303?color=7289DA&label=Discord&logo=Discord&style=for-the-badge\" />\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>向玩家展示你的代词</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">从预设中选择或使用自定义设置！</font>\n    <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/546JrJ6.png\" width=\"50%\" style=\"border: 5px solid black\"/>\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"6\"><b>自豪地展示旗帜</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">你可以从丰富的选择中展示最多两面骄傲旗（Pride flags）！</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">旗帜的位置也可以更改。</font>\n    <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5VxICBH.png\" width=\"45%\" style=\"border: 5px solid black\"/>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/FGAO6TY.png\" width=\"45%\" style=\"border: 5px solid black\"/>\n\n</div>\n<br>\n<div align=\"center\">\n  <font size=\"4\">其他玩家也将能够看到你的旗帜</font>\n  <br><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rPbeBoQ.png\" width=\"60%\" style=\"border: 5px solid black\"/>\n\n</div>\n<br>\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n  <font size=\"6\"><b>重要提示！</b></font>\n  <br>\n  <font size=\"4\">部分玩家可能会恶意使用不当内容，因此 SYI 内置了“仇恨词过滤器”（Slur Filter）。</font>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  <font size=\"4\">默认情况下，超过 500 个词汇被列为禁用词。其中包括恐同和跨性别歧视的仇恨言论，以及法西斯主义等仇恨意识形态相关的词汇。欢迎使用 <b>/syi</b> 命令或手动添加词汇来创建更安全的社区空间。</font>\n  <br>\n  <br>\n  <font size=\"4\">该文件位于 <b>.../config/</b> 目录下，名为 <b>slurs_filter.txt</b>。</font>  <br>\n  <font size=\"4\">如果没有找到文件，数据将源自 GitHub 仓库 <b>sawdev1/better-profane-words</b>。</font>\n\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>玩家指令</b></font>\n    <font size=\"4\">(所有玩家均可使用)</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">获取某玩家的代词</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi pronouns get &ltplayer&gt</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">设置你自己的代词</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi pronouns set &ltpronouns&gt</b></font>\n     <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">重置你自己的代词</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi pronouns reset</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">设置你自己的骄傲旗</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi flag set &ltprimary|secondary&gt &ltflag&gt</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">重置你自己的骄傲旗</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi flag reset &ltprimary|secondary&gt</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">调整骄傲旗的位置</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi flag position &ltplayer_name|pronouns&gt</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">获取旗帜及身份/倾向的简短描述</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi flag info  &ltflag&gt</b></font>\n    <br>\n \n</div>\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n<div align=\"left\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>管理员指令</b></font>\n    <font size=\"4\">(仅 OP 可使用)</font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">重置某玩家的身份信息数据</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi reset player &ltplayer&gt</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">重置所有玩家的身份信息数据</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi reset all</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">添加禁止设置为代词的词汇（主要是仇恨言论）</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi slur_filter add &ltword&gt</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\">重新加载仇恨词过滤器文件</font>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"> <b>/syi slur_filter reload</b></font>\n    <br>\n</div>\n\n<br>\n<hr>\n<br>\n\n<div align=\"center\">\n    <font size=\"5\"><b>支持的语言</b></font>\n    <br>\n    <br>\n<img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1fa-1f1f8.png\" width=\"32\" title=\"en_us\">\n<img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e9-1f1ea.png\" width=\"32\" title=\"de_de\"> \n    <br>\n    <br>\n    <font size=\"4\"><b>与 Lusobit Studio 合作的翻译</b></font>\n    <div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e7-1f1f7.png\" width=\"32\">\n        <font size=\"4\"> 由 @EUSOUEFEMERO 和 @iago_emanuel15 翻译</font>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e6-1f1f7.png\" width=\"32\">\n        <font size=\"4\"> 由 @franstachiotti 和 @firemortal10 翻译</font>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1ee-1f1f9.png\" width=\"32\">\n        <font size=\"4\"> 由 @milomiletto 和 @PieroAzZZ 翻译</font>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1e8-1f1f3.png\" width=\"32\">\n        <font size=\"4\"> 由 @daisy_comment 翻译</font>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1ef-1f1f5.png\" width=\"32\">\n        <font size=\"4\"> 由 @ashwall_penguin 翻译</font>\n    </div>\n    <div>\n        <img src=\"https://abs.twimg.com/emoji/v2/72x72/1f1eb-1f1f7.png\" width=\"32\">\n        <font size=\"4\"> 由 @RoseDorleans 翻译</font>\n    </div>\n</div>",
